<!doctype html><html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>08-am-nhac</title><style>*{margin:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dde6f6 0,#f9f1e6 460px);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#463029}
.serif{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif}
em{font-style:italic;color:#c4596b}
.clay{background:#fffdf8;border-radius:34px;box-shadow:inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8),0 18px 46px rgba(150,95,75,.2)}
.pill{display:inline-block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:#fae3e6;color:#a8394e;box-shadow:inset 0 1.5px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.pill.g{background:#cdeacf;color:#2e6b45}.pill.b{background:#dde6f6;color:#3d5a96}.pill.y{background:#f6e7c8;color:#8a621c}
.kick{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c4596b}
h2.title{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:72px;margin-top:10px}
.muted{color:#8d7166}
</style></head><body>
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('../../assets/img/creative_library.jpg') center/cover"></div>
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(249,241,230,.97) 0 30%,rgba(249,241,230,.4) 58%,transparent)"></div>
<div style="position:relative;padding:660px 110px 0;display:flex;gap:60px;align-items:flex-start">
  <div style="flex:1.2">
    <div class="kick">Thư viện sáng tạo</div>
    <h2 class="serif" style="font-size:64px;margin-top:8px">Songbook «Je m'appelle <em>Hương</em>»</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.5">Mini song-cycle / EP · 5 chương · 7 bản thu · sáng tác 07–10/08/2026 — tiếng Pháp đan tiếng Việt, từ «Je voudrais te parler» đến «La lampe brûle encore».</p>
  </div>
  <div style="flex:1;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:26px">
    <span class="pill" style="font-size:21px">🎼 5 chương</span><span class="pill g" style="font-size:21px">🎙️ 7 bản thu</span><span class="pill b" style="font-size:21px">🎬 MV «Mekong Sunfire» (H3)</span><span class="pill y" style="font-size:21px">🌐 …/JESUISHUONG_WEBSITE_2026/songbook.html</span>
  </div>
</div></body></html>